<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5636"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Gramsleuth<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Gramsleuth<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 7:32 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK did Hedge and Davis.  It&#39;s so obvious. <BR> <BR>WPD better wake up.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5636-->
<!--Post: 6525--><!--Time: 1107851581-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6525"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sgtrandolph<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sgtrandolph<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 08, 2005 - 12:33 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->There was a mention on one of the sites, I think America&#39;s Most Wanted, that stated recent communications revealed additional victims ... this may or may not be true, but I&#39;ve got a gut feeling that he didn&#39;t stop in 1986.  He even states in one of his letters that he is unable to stop himself.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6525-->
<!--Post: 6529--><!--Time: 1107853564-->
